# MIDI Output

Complete MIDI channel architecture, Control Change mapping, and voice
configuration for the Heliosonic Sonifier. Values are taken directly from
`MidiProxy` and `MIDIController`.

---

## 16-channel architecture

| CH | Voice | Role | Polyphony |
|:--:|-------|------|:---------:|
| 1 | `DRONE_BASS` | Bass drone layer | 4 |
| 2 | `DRONE_MID` | Mid drone layer | 4 |
| 3 | `DRONE_HIGH` | High drone layer | 4 |
| 4 | `MELODY` | Melodic voice | 2 |
| 5 | `GLITCH` | Glitch effects | 12 |
| 6 | `CHORD` | Chordal pads | 8 |
| 7 | `AMBIENT` | Ambient textures | 6 |
| 8 | `RHYTHM` | Rhythmic patterns | 8 |
| 9 | `PULSE` | Rhythmic pulse | 4 |
| 10 | `HARMONIC` | Harmonic layers | 6 |
| 11 | `TEXTURE` | Textural layers | 8 |
| 12 | `FX` | Sound effects | 6 |
| 13 | `RECALLED` | Recalled patterns | 4 |
| 14 | `SILENCE` | Silence voice | 2 |
| 15 | `VISIBLE` | **CCs only** (automation) | 0 |
| 16 | `INTERNAL` | **CCs only** (expressive) | 0 |

**Total polyphony:** 128 notes across channels 1–14.

---

## Voice priorities

Used for voice-stealing when a channel exceeds its polyphony limit
(higher = more likely to be preserved).

| Voice | Priority | Voice | Priority |
|-------|:--------:|-------|:--------:|
| `melody` | 10 | `pulse` | 5 |
| `glitch` | 8 | `recalled` | 5 |
| `rhythm` / `rhythmic` | 8 | `ambient` | 4 |
| `drone` / `drone_*` | 7 | `texture` | 3 |
| `chord` | 6 | `fx` | 3 |
| `harmonic` | 6 | `silence` | 2 |

---

