## Release envelopes

Base release time per voice (modulated 0.3×–3.0× by chaos, storm, p/g-modes).

| Voice | Release (s) | Voice | Release (s) |
|-------|:-----------:|-------|:-----------:|
| `drone_bass` | 2.5 | `pulse` | 0.3 |
| `drone` / `drone_mid` | 2.0 | `harmonic` | 1.2 |
| `drone_high` | 1.5 | `fx` | 0.8 |
| `melody` | 0.5 | `recalled` | 0.3 |
| `glitch` | 0.05 | `silence` | 3.0 |
| `rhythm` / `rhythmic` | 0.1 | `texture` | 2.0 |
| `chord` | 1.0 | `ambient` | 1.5 |

