## Channel 15 — Visible CCs (system automation)

Sent automatically and can modulate any VST parameter in your DAW.

| CC | Parameter | CC | Parameter |
|:--:|-----------|:--:|-----------|
| 20 | Chaos | 24 | Tension |
| 21 | Density | 25 | Storm intensity |
| 22 | Register | 26 | Bz (normalized) |
| 23 | Glitch intensity | 27 | Speed (normalized) |

### Extended CCs (40–72)

| CC | Parameter | CC | Parameter |
|:--:|-----------|:--:|-----------|
| 40–43 | Bx / By / Bt / temperature | 52–53 | Interval / scale shift |
| 44–46 | Kp / Dst / F10.7 | 54 | Swing amount |
| 47–48 | Latitude / longitude | 55–56 | Note repeat / bit crush |
| 49–51 | Patterns learned / recalled / active | 57–58 | Polyrhythm / time signature |
| 59 | Musical state | 60 | Activity |
| 70 | p-mode | 71 | g-mode | 72 | Sunspot |

