## Batch mode

| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Batch interval | 10 ms |
| Max queue size | 200 messages |
| Batched voices | ambient, texture, fx, recalled, silence, pulse |
| High-priority | melody, glitch, rhythm, drone, chord |

