## Recommended DAW setup

```text
Heliosonic → MIDI Out → DAW (Ableton / Logic / Reaper) → VST / Synth → Audio


### Windows Setup

1. Install **LoopMIDI**
2. Create a virtual port named **"Heliosonic Out"**
3. In your DAW, create a MIDI track receiving from **"Heliosonic Out"**

### VST Recommendations

| Voice       | Recommended Instruments                     |
|-------------|---------------------------------------------|
| Drone Bass  | Serum, Massive, Diva                        |
| Melody      | Kontakt, Vital                              |
| Glitch      | Effectrix, Stutter Edit, Glitchmachines     |
| Ambient     | Valhalla, Omnisphere, Zebra                 |
| Rhythm      | Battery, Drum Rack (Ableton)                |

